Suggests: calamares
Description: Argon OS first-party applications
 Argon's own desktop applications:
 .
  * Argon Software — a curated software center. Browse categories,
    search, and install or remove applications with one click; package
    operations are authenticated through polkit.
  * Argon Welcome — the first-login greeter that points new users at
    the installer, the software center, the privacy defaults and the
    documentation.
 .
 Neither application communicates with any network service; the catalog
 is local and installs go through APT.
